Correct:
static List<Integer> members(BitSet bits) {
  List<Integer> out = new ArrayList<>(bits.cardinality());
  for (int i = bits.nextSetBit(0); i >= 0; i = bits.nextSetBit(i + 1)) out.add(i);
  return out;
}
Complexity: O(1) per bit operation; O(size / 64 + members) to iterate

