int bottom = stack.get(0); // index access breaks the stack abstraction
Correct:
Deque<Integer> stack = new ArrayDeque<>();
stack.push(1);
stack.push(2);
int top = stack.peek(); // 2
Complexity: O(1) amortised per operation

