```javascript
// 5. Floyd: detect a cycle and return the node where it starts (or null).
function cycleStart(head) {
  let slow = head, fast = head;
  while (fast && fast.next) {
    slow = slow.next;
    fast = fast.next.next;
    if (slow === fast) {
      let p = head;
      while (p !== slow) { p = p.next; slow = slow.next; }
      return p;
    }
  }
  return null;
}
```

Snippets 1 and 3, followed by an alternating interleave of the two halves (snippet 4's loop without the comparison), make up the corpus's Reorder List solution, which makes it the natural capstone for this track.

