Explanation: A stack fits whenever the most recent open item is the next one to close: matching brackets, evaluating postfix expressions, undoing moves, replacing recursion and finding the next greater element. Ask whether each new item resolves the newest pending one. If it does, push pending items and pop them as they are resolved.
